            "paragraph": "A key study in the need for sensor overlap is that of Loeb et al. (2009), who looked at overlap requirements for measurement of the cloud radiative effect (CRE, which is defined as the difference between clear-sky and all-sky net top-of-atmosphere radiative flux) using the CERES instruments that have been in orbit since 1999.",
