            "target_entity_instance": "temperature",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "In this section, we will illustrate errors in trends derived from tropospheric data due to changes in the orbit of the satellite carrying the observing instrument. The first case is that of the Microwave Sounding Unit (MSU). The instrument was designed to measure the temperature in broad layers of the Earth's lower and middle troposphere.",
