            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "The second case is the observation of a large decadal change in Tropical (20 N to 20 S) outgoing longwave radiation (OLR) from the Earth Radiation Budget Satellites (ERBS) designed to measure the planetary energy balance by observing the total infrared radiation emitted by the Earth (commonly referred to as outgoing longwave radiation or OLR) and the total visible radiation (commonly referred to as SW, for \u201cshort wavelength\") reflected from the Earth.",
